    ('portfolio', 'Portfolio', 'Web Development', 'This site — a server-rendered Nuxt 4 frontend with a Go API and MySQL behind it, containerised and deployed behind Nginx and Cloudflare.', 'This site is the smallest honest example of the stack I work in: a server-rendered Nuxt 4 frontend, a Go API handling the one route that genuinely needs a server, MySQL for the data that must persist, and a container setup that runs the same way locally and in production.',
